gametitle=Steambot Chronicles (USA) SLUS-21344 9F391882

[60 FPS]
author=heavyjam
description=Experimental 60 FPS with on-foot and follower speed corrections, normal Trotmobile cruising, acceleration, steering and camera-follow corrections, plus animation, idle-gesture timing and clock fixes. On-foot running distance, follower speeds, measured animation cycles, idle-gesture intervals and clock rate matched stock. Native controller tests compared vehicle acceleration, stopping and five normal steering modes against stock; forward animation playback remains corrected. On-foot turn smoothing, camera obstruction transitions, other attachments, boost, jumping, combat, other physics, rhythm games and cutscenes remain unverified and may run fast. Tested at 2x internal resolution on a Radeon 880M without EE Overclock; vehicle comparisons used 1x. Reduce resolution if emulator speed drops. After enabling or disabling, restart and load from the memory card. Older savestates can retain incorrect animation rates or code from another timing patch.
